{"person_id":"ly1208","year":2022,"events":[{"event_id":"speech:d746fe3e3d0d8a4c","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2022-12-29","date_start":"2022-12-29","date_end":"2022-12-29","meeting_id":"委員會-10-6-36-30","meeting":"第10屆第6會期司法及法制委員會第30次全體委員會議","bill_id":null,"title":"第10屆第6會期司法及法制委員會第30次全體委員會議","party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"cross_source","topics":{"education":0.14589921990301497,"government":0.48176259751212314,"health":0.09276829011174363,"unclassified":0.10246679316888045,"law_crime":0.17710309930423782},"citation_count":8,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/18/LCIDC01_1121801.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1121801_00003/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"67-146","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"陳委員靜敏","snapshot":"461b89d36957f2ba45c4e4aebeaa1b66240f95576105e1020ead0f37c3558b8f"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/18/LCIDC01_1121801.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1121801_00003/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"67-146","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"陳委員靜敏","snapshot":"461b89d36957f2ba45c4e4aebeaa1b66240f95576105e1020ead0f37c3558b8f"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_ivods","official_url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/143275","link_kind":"ivod","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/ivods?%E5%B1%86=10&%E6%9C%83%E6%9C%9F=6&limit=1000&page=1","verification_status":"official_video_index_unreviewed","printed_pages":null,"pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"陳靜敏","snapshot":"698de52f7e47a7da1891204d179b5bb81d5d3b127031b1396b1d3003ba04e77e"}],"highlights":{"education":{"excerpt":"我看到今天列席的官員裡面，教育部是學生事務特殊教育司的鄭專委，我不曉得可不可以請鄭專委跟教育部再幫我push一下，跟考試院建立一個溝通的平臺？","terms":["教育部","教育","學生"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":6,"citation":0},"government":{"excerpt":"我今天其實比較想要請問的是考試院秘書長，我們知道知道考試院的組織其實主要的目的就是為了幫助我們的文官法制，或者是對相關的文官人才做最好的掄才制度，特別是配合現在社會跟政府執政的政策要求，變成轉型為稱職的國家人力資源部門，所以很重要的，如果有","terms":["考試院","文官"],"cut":[false,true],"hits":4,"citation":1},"health":{"excerpt":"特別是在這次COVID-19疫情的時候，看到護理人力短缺的問題，所以怎麼樣讓學校已經教好、準備好的這些護理人員能夠即時考試、即時進入職場，應該是解決整個政府部門或者是整備醫療照護體系非常重要的策略。","terms":["疫情","護理","醫療"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":0},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"今天是會期最後一天，但是我是第一次有機會來司法及法制委員會報到，大概瞭解司法及法制委員會的運作，我看到今天委員的發言都集中在外役監條例的修正為主，但是因為我來不及參與這個修法，所以我今天比較想討論的反而是考銓處組織條例的廢止案。","terms":["司法"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1}}},{"event_id":"bill:1111230070200200","kind":"bill_proposal","activity":"bill_cosign","role":"cosigner","date":"2023-01-09","date_start":"2023-01-09","date_end":"2023-01-09","meeting_id":"院會-10-6-15","meeting":"第10屆第6會期第15次會議","bill_id":"1111230070200200","title":"「地方民意代表費用支給及村里長事務補助費補助條例第六條條文修正草案」，請審議案。","party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"cross_source","topics":{"labor":1.0},"citation_count":2,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1111230070200200/details","link_kind":"bill_page","verification_status":"third_party_index","snapshot":"a762ff251d3a8a95df1519a0d3152db2d28cfa4f840a611198adb2ef22dd29a8"}]},{"event_id":"bill:1111230070200300","kind":"bill_proposal","activity":"bill_cosign","role":"cosigner","date":"2023-01-09","date_start":"2023-01-09","date_end":"2023-01-09","meeting_id":"院會-10-6-15","meeting":"第10屆第6會期第15次會議","bill_id":"1111230070200300","title":"「廢棄物清理法部分條文修正草案」，請審議案。","party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"cross_source","topics":{"environment":1.0},"citation_count":2,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1111230070200300/details","link_kind":"bill_page","verification_status":"third_party_index","snapshot":"a762ff251d3a8a95df15